OL,3,GNEWSAMore infant remains uncovered at
OL,4,Aformer mother-and-baby home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe team excavating the site of a
OL,7,Fformer mother-and-baby institution in
OL,8,FCounty Galway has uncovered the remains
OL,9,Fof another 10 children.
OL,11,FThe latest update in the ongoing search
OL,12,Fin Tuam brings the total number of
OL,13,Finfant remains found to 109.
OL,15,FThe mother-and-baby institution was in
OL,16,Foperation from 1925 until 1961.
OL,18,FIt came to international attention in
OL,19,F2014 - after local researcher Catherine
OL,20,FCorless found 796 death certificates
OL,21,Ffor children and babies who were in the
OL,22,Finstitution, but no burial records.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
